{"id":"00402","root":"uni00402_1","name":{"ja":"若い天音","en":"Young Amane"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"若い天音","en":"Young Amane"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-11-25","limited":true,"characterId":248,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍。ふうま一門の由緒正しい家系の生まれで主人公の親戚にあたる。強力な邪眼故、幼い頃から戦場に駆り出され苛烈な幼少時代を過ごす。彼女の父・権正は彼女を恐れ疎んじため、宗家当主・弾正が彼女を引き取った。好戦的で死を恐れぬ戦いぶりから“戦闘マシーン”と恐れられている。ついた渾名が“悪鬼羅刹”。しかし本人は気にした風もなく今日も殺戮の中心にいる。","en":"She is a Taimanin, born into the prestigious Fuuma family and a relative of Fuuma Kotaro. Due to her powerful evil eye, she was sent to the battlefield from a young age and had a harsh childhood. Her father, Fuuma Gonsho, feared and avoided her, so Fuuma Danjo, the head of the main family, took her in. She is feared as a \"fighting machine\" due to her aggressive and fearless fighting style, earning her the nickname \"Akki Rasetsu\". However, she doesn't seem to mind and continues to be at the center of the carnage."},"illustrator":"新堂エル","voiceActor":"一ノ瀬さくら","forms":[{"id":"uni00402_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1424,2848],"sp":[130,130],"atk":[192,384],"def":[157,314],"spd":[82,82],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","860004"]},{"id":"uni00402_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2048,4096],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[284,568],"def":[214,428],"spd":[82,82],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","860004","860005"]},{"id":"uni00402_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2672,5346],"sp":[360,360],"atk":[376,750],"def":[271,544],"spd":[82,82],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","860004","860005","860006"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメー